<title>USA: Typhoon Violet still threatens shipping off Japan.</title>
<headline>Typhoon Violet still threatens shipping off Japan.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Typhoon Violet is mainly a major risk to shipping in the region southeast and east of Okinawa, Japan, during the next 48 hours, private forecaster Weather Services Corp. said.</p>
<p>The forecast track of this system is uncertain, and there is some chance it may turn more to the north, threatening Japan.</p>
